WEBVTT

00:06.381 --> 00:09.175
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND PRODUCTS
ARE FICTIONAL AND DRAMATIZED

00:09.259 --> 00:10.468
AND DO NOT REFLECT REALITY

00:26.484 --> 00:28.445
The visitation has started.

00:31.948 --> 00:33.491
I see we have a greenhorn.

00:36.161 --> 00:37.579
Have you ever done a prelim?

00:39.330 --> 00:40.206
Yes.

00:41.166 --> 00:42.250
And you came like that?

00:44.627 --> 00:46.546
Look at you, displaying your ID.

00:47.589 --> 00:50.175
Listen up. I'm not going to say it twice.

00:52.761 --> 00:54.220
Have you heard of "Boudoir"?

00:54.304 --> 00:57.766
The regional head there, Sarah Kim.

00:58.808 --> 01:00.977
This story is about that crazy bitch.

01:03.229 --> 01:05.523
THE ART OF SARAH

01:07.567 --> 01:10.987
SARAH KIM

01:16.743 --> 01:17.786
Do you also

01:18.453 --> 01:19.954
kill people for money?

01:22.165 --> 01:23.249
Ma'am,

01:23.750 --> 01:26.044
didn't you see the sign out front?

01:26.544 --> 01:28.755
We only recover money owed.

01:29.380 --> 01:32.258
So, how much are you owed?

01:32.342 --> 01:33.635
Fifteen billion won.

01:36.221 --> 01:37.889
I may not kill people,

01:38.932 --> 01:40.767
but I can make them wish they were dead.

01:46.648 --> 01:48.274
- That's her, right?
- Yes, sir.

01:57.117 --> 01:59.244
- What's she doing?
- She's giving him her gloves.

01:59.744 --> 02:02.205
Just the kind of thing
that makes someone hated.

02:03.665 --> 02:06.209
Well-meaning deeds get people killed.

02:06.835 --> 02:10.964
Who'd give money to a homeless guy
wearing such expensive gloves?

02:12.799 --> 02:15.718
She has absolutely no idea
how the world works.

02:17.720 --> 02:19.430
She even gave him her scarf, boss.

02:21.349 --> 02:22.725
Or when to back off.

02:22.809 --> 02:23.977
You see,

02:24.060 --> 02:27.021
I was going to give her a scare
and back off.

02:27.105 --> 02:29.482
I had no intention
of resorting to violence.

02:31.401 --> 02:32.402
Man.

02:37.323 --> 02:39.701
Look at her using English,
now that she's in a bind.

02:39.784 --> 02:41.703
What'd you do with the stolen 15 billion?

02:49.502 --> 02:51.671
What else would I do
with the investment money?

02:51.754 --> 02:52.881
I ran a business.

02:53.715 --> 02:57.218
I threw a launch party,
paid the store deposit, paid the staff…

02:58.761 --> 03:00.763
- What's wrong with that?
- So, what?

03:01.347 --> 03:02.599
You spent it all?

03:02.682 --> 03:04.851
If I'm going to do it,
I want to do it right.

03:07.061 --> 03:10.148
The new collection launches next week.
I can pay back in full.

03:10.231 --> 03:11.482
If you give me a week--

03:11.566 --> 03:14.485
Are you saying
you can't give me the money?

03:15.486 --> 03:16.362
Collateral.

03:16.863 --> 03:18.448
I can give you collateral.

03:21.910 --> 03:22.994
"Collateral"?

03:24.329 --> 03:25.830
Boudoir bags.

03:26.497 --> 03:27.498
"Boudoir bags"?

03:27.999 --> 03:29.000
What's that?

03:29.083 --> 03:29.918
Look it up.

03:30.001 --> 03:30.835
Yes, boss.

03:33.713 --> 03:34.547
Boss.

03:35.048 --> 03:36.925
These cost over 100 million won apiece!

03:37.008 --> 03:39.093
You fool. No bag costs 100 million.

03:39.177 --> 03:40.345
You ignorant fool!

03:47.393 --> 03:48.561
System disarmed.

03:49.062 --> 03:50.897
So, is this Boudoir?

03:50.980 --> 03:53.608
It looks pricey from the entrance.
Check out the flooring.

03:53.691 --> 03:55.568
It's all carpet, right?

03:55.652 --> 03:58.238
This is one of those Persian rugs
or something, right?

03:58.863 --> 03:59.906
Mind the stairs, boss.

03:59.989 --> 04:01.658
Wow!

04:03.743 --> 04:04.619
Look at this!

04:05.411 --> 04:07.288
Holy shit, right?

04:07.789 --> 04:10.792
A hundred million won. Two hundred million
won. Three hundred million…

04:10.875 --> 04:13.127
- Hey, hurry up and grab them!
- Yes, boss.

04:13.211 --> 04:14.754
Boss, how should we get these out?

04:15.255 --> 04:16.714
Why are you asking me, you fool?

04:16.798 --> 04:18.383
You need keys to unlock them.

04:20.843 --> 04:21.803
Where are they?

04:22.595 --> 04:23.596
Here.

04:28.559 --> 04:30.395
- Here. Hey, catch!
- Yes, boss.

04:32.105 --> 04:33.731
Even at a glance, they look expensive.

04:34.399 --> 04:36.526
The ones inside the room
are more expensive.

04:40.196 --> 04:42.740
Hey. Grab the ones inside first.

04:42.824 --> 04:44.158
- Yes, boss.
- Yes, boss.

04:44.242 --> 04:46.703
These poor bastards have no taste.

04:47.203 --> 04:48.329
Right?

04:49.122 --> 04:50.832
It's because they grew up poor.

04:51.666 --> 04:53.001
Wow!

04:53.710 --> 04:55.169
What do we have here?

04:55.670 --> 04:59.048
Isn't this like Baroque
or Renaissance or something?

05:00.383 --> 05:03.636
This would look absolutely killer
hanging in our office.

05:03.720 --> 05:05.054
Moron.

05:06.431 --> 05:08.141
What did you just say?

05:08.224 --> 05:10.226
I called you a fucking moron.

05:11.185 --> 05:14.147
Why steal if you can't even tell
what's valuable?

05:15.648 --> 05:18.109
Take it. It's a forgery anyway.

05:18.192 --> 05:19.193
I see.

05:19.861 --> 05:21.571
A forgery, huh? Why, you!

05:23.114 --> 05:24.365
Are you crazy?

05:25.908 --> 05:26.743
What the…

05:27.994 --> 05:29.495
What's going on? Huh?

05:29.579 --> 05:30.913
The shutters are closing!

05:33.166 --> 05:35.877
Hey, snap out of it!
Look for the keys over there!

05:35.960 --> 05:37.337
Okay, got it!

05:38.921 --> 05:40.048
Crazy bitch! Get out.

05:40.131 --> 05:41.132
Get out here!

05:41.215 --> 05:43.343
Get the fuck out of here! Out!

05:43.426 --> 05:45.845
Open it. Get that thing opened.

05:45.928 --> 05:47.889
I said open that fucking thing!

05:48.389 --> 05:49.265
Move!

05:49.349 --> 05:52.310
Damn you, you crazy bitch! Fuck!

05:53.353 --> 05:55.188
I'm sorry. Please don't hurt me.

05:55.271 --> 05:58.358
- I'm sorry. Please don't--
- Open it now before I kill you.

05:58.441 --> 05:59.901
Hey, find the keys! Now!

06:01.778 --> 06:04.364
- You still don't get it, do you?
- What?

06:05.907 --> 06:08.201
Secom will be here
in less than five minutes.

06:09.535 --> 06:11.746
Even this is all on camera right now.

06:12.372 --> 06:13.206
What?

06:17.710 --> 06:18.836
Please don't kill me.

06:19.545 --> 06:21.547
I'm sorry. Please don't kill me.

06:22.590 --> 06:23.549
Please spare me!

06:24.425 --> 06:26.803
I'm so sorry. Please don't kill me.

06:26.886 --> 06:30.223
- Fuck!
- Please don't kill me.

06:31.849 --> 06:36.145
After that, the bitch sued me
for kidnapping, assault, and extortion.

06:36.646 --> 06:39.899
Jeong Yeo-jin said she hired me
to get her money back, not assault her,

06:39.982 --> 06:41.943
and pinned it all on me.

06:42.026 --> 06:42.860
But get this.

06:42.944 --> 06:45.071
The name of the person suing me

06:45.571 --> 06:48.032
wasn't Sarah Kim but Woo Hyo-eun.

06:49.283 --> 06:51.160
The last name wasn't even "Kim."

06:51.244 --> 06:53.621
It was odd, so I had my boys look into it.

06:54.205 --> 06:56.707
Turns out that Woo Hyo-eun

06:57.375 --> 07:01.170
was Sarah's former employee
who recently left the company.

07:01.963 --> 07:05.049
That means Sarah Kim sued me
while impersonating Woo Hyo-eun.

07:05.716 --> 07:09.011
This is a tactic con artists use a lot

07:09.512 --> 07:12.390
by extorting money
and then inciting violence.

07:12.473 --> 07:16.644
The perpetrator becomes the victim,
and you lose the upper hand.

07:17.562 --> 07:20.022
The key figures
in the Sarah Kim murder case are

07:20.106 --> 07:22.442
Jeong Yeo-jin, Min Byeong-kwan,
and Woo Hyo-eun.

07:22.525 --> 07:25.027
This is the information
I obtained from the tip-off.

07:28.573 --> 07:30.658
This does appear to be a con.

07:31.284 --> 07:34.078
Why do you think she did this
when there's an easier way?

07:34.787 --> 07:37.206
She could've fled
when she got the 15 billion won.

07:37.874 --> 07:39.876
What if she wasn't satisfied
with 15 billion?

07:42.128 --> 07:43.337
Ponzi scheme.

07:43.421 --> 07:45.756
There may be more victims of the scam.

07:46.424 --> 07:49.260
At this point,
is Jeong Yeo-jin the prime suspect?

07:49.343 --> 07:52.346
No. The Financial Crimes Unit
had been watching her

07:52.430 --> 07:53.973
since the kidnapping case.

07:54.056 --> 07:56.601
The partials from the bag
didn't match hers either.

07:56.684 --> 07:59.520
Do we know who Kim contacted
on the day of the murder?

07:59.604 --> 08:01.272
Yes, they've been identified.

08:18.289 --> 08:21.125
BOUDOIR 2024 S/S PREVIEW PARTY

08:37.892 --> 08:39.268
POLITICAL/BUSINESS CIRCLES

08:39.352 --> 08:40.186
ENTERTAINMENT

08:46.442 --> 08:47.735
SHIN SO-UI

08:49.654 --> 08:50.613
SHIN SO-UI
ACTOR

08:53.115 --> 08:54.242
BOUDOIR

08:54.825 --> 08:57.954
BOUDOIR BAG, WHY IT WAS THE PERFECT CHOICE

08:58.246 --> 09:00.706
I GOT THE LUXURY BOUDOIR BAG LOVED
BY EUROPEAN ROYALS FOR 100 YEARS

09:01.374 --> 09:02.208
CHEONGDAM GODDESS

09:02.291 --> 09:03.459
Five years ago?

09:14.470 --> 09:15.513
POSTS FOR 010-5780-4913

09:15.596 --> 09:18.349
SEEKING PART-TIME
DEPARTMENT STORE LINE SITTERS

09:23.104 --> 09:23.938
LINE SITTERS WANTED

09:24.021 --> 09:27.024
CREATE A NEW OPEN PROFILE

09:30.736 --> 09:31.571
DOGGO

09:35.074 --> 09:36.450
TRAILER

10:00.182 --> 10:02.560
HI! I'M INTERESTED
IN THE PART-TIME LINE-SITTING JOB

10:02.643 --> 10:04.437
CAN YOU HANDLE
LESS SLEEP AND LESS FAMILY TIME?

10:04.520 --> 10:05.521
DOING THAT ALREADY

10:05.605 --> 10:08.065
CAN YOU COME
TO THE DEPARTMENT STORE RIGHT NOW?

10:08.149 --> 10:12.737
ON MY WAY ALREADY

10:13.237 --> 10:14.405
THE PASS NECKLACE IN THEIR HAND

10:15.114 --> 10:16.741
Whoa, sir!

10:19.994 --> 10:21.871
- Ms. Resell Queen?
- Here.

10:22.371 --> 10:24.081
- Ms. Chic Sister?
- Here.

10:24.165 --> 10:26.292
- Mr. Rolex Shrek?
- Right here.

10:27.001 --> 10:28.711
- Ms. Debt Coin?
- Yes.

10:30.129 --> 10:32.465
- Ms. Chanel Number Seven?
- Here.

10:33.090 --> 10:34.508
- Mr. Doggo?
- Here.

10:37.136 --> 10:38.763
All right, everyone!

10:40.056 --> 10:43.601
Line-sitting is the only thing
in the world

10:44.101 --> 10:45.895
where endurance means victory.

10:45.978 --> 10:47.688
Chanel is the cheapest today,

10:47.772 --> 10:51.442
Rolex will still be sold out tomorrow,
and so we line up again.

10:51.525 --> 10:53.653
All right. Today's first in line is…

10:56.864 --> 10:58.991
A round of applause
for Ms. Balenci-mother!

10:59.575 --> 11:00.534
Congratulations!

11:00.618 --> 11:02.370
Congratulations!

11:03.079 --> 11:04.497
I'm so jealous.

11:06.248 --> 11:08.501
- I'm so jealous.
- Yeah, seriously.

11:10.336 --> 11:13.005
You've got to be kidding me.
What are you doing?

11:13.089 --> 11:14.298
Sorry?

11:15.424 --> 11:17.176
Mr. Doggo, don't tell me

11:18.469 --> 11:19.845
that's all you're wearing!

11:20.638 --> 11:22.890
Goodness, you'll catch a cold.

11:24.475 --> 11:26.644
You're lucky we're waiting indoors today.

11:26.727 --> 11:27.978
Your body's an asset.

11:28.062 --> 11:29.271
Thank you.

11:32.066 --> 11:34.026
Is this your first time as a line sitter?

11:34.944 --> 11:37.613
Yeah, I'm saving every bit I can
to buy luxury stuff.

11:37.697 --> 11:38.739
Right.

11:38.823 --> 11:40.241
Your first luxury item.

11:40.783 --> 11:42.868
Yes, that's special. It really is.

11:43.953 --> 11:44.870
What brand?

11:44.954 --> 11:46.539
Balen? Maison?

11:48.124 --> 11:51.293
You're slender, so I think
Saint Laurent would look great on you.

11:53.713 --> 11:54.755
Boudoir.

11:58.092 --> 11:59.510
Don't buy from there.

12:00.052 --> 12:02.638
Any luxury good
below the Big Three standards is crap.

12:02.722 --> 12:04.640
Isn't Boudoir the most popular right now?

12:04.724 --> 12:06.809
I've seen many reviews
on online communities.

12:06.892 --> 12:09.270
Bullshit! That's all fabricated!

12:10.479 --> 12:14.692
Look, Boudoir only sells
to the genuine VVIP.

12:15.192 --> 12:19.572
Do you really think people like that
would personally write reviews online?

12:19.655 --> 12:22.491
How do you know all that?
You must be a pro at this.

12:26.912 --> 12:29.206
I used to work at Boudoir.

12:30.124 --> 12:31.417
I was scouted, actually.

12:31.500 --> 12:34.336
Wow! Then you must know Sarah Kim well.

12:50.394 --> 12:54.023
I'm sorry for back then.
Our customer policies are quite strict.

12:56.317 --> 12:59.737
I would think you could be flexible
and ignore the rules from time to time.

13:00.571 --> 13:02.156
I guess you don't do that.

13:03.115 --> 13:04.533
I can do better.

13:05.576 --> 13:07.411
I'm saying that I like that attitude.

13:10.748 --> 13:12.666
It makes me curious about your taste.

13:13.167 --> 13:14.877
I needed to win her over.

13:15.628 --> 13:18.756
She was someone who spent
tens of millions on each visit.

13:18.839 --> 13:19.673
How is this color?

13:19.757 --> 13:23.177
I couldn't ignore the commission
from those sales either.

13:24.887 --> 13:27.598
I don't think I need to see anymore.
We're done.

13:34.688 --> 13:36.190
No, I don't think that's it.

13:36.273 --> 13:37.942
It is. Look at this.

13:38.442 --> 13:39.276
Hey, this is…

13:39.360 --> 13:41.654
- This?
- No, this is how you do it.

13:41.737 --> 13:42.613
- Then…
- Damn it!

13:42.696 --> 13:44.281
- Excuse me.
- No, I mean…

13:44.782 --> 13:46.826
Could you at least turn the sound off?

13:49.453 --> 13:51.413
And isn't the food court downstairs?

13:55.668 --> 13:57.336
Where were you?

13:57.419 --> 13:59.046
I was on my break. Why?

13:59.547 --> 14:02.341
It was Sarah Kim.
It was so crazy a moment ago.

14:02.424 --> 14:04.677
- Did she file a complaint?
- It's not that.

14:04.760 --> 14:07.388
She purchased every single bag
you showed her.

14:07.888 --> 14:09.932
And paid the full amount in cash again.

14:10.432 --> 14:13.644
She also asked me
to pass this onto you, Hyo-eun.

14:29.118 --> 14:32.079
Actually, she was the one
who bought my loyalty.

14:35.666 --> 14:37.251
For a mere 3,000 won.

14:56.604 --> 14:58.772
Call me if you want to change jobs.

15:00.524 --> 15:02.401
What is this place?

15:03.110 --> 15:06.030
The Boudoir flagship store
will be built here.

15:07.031 --> 15:09.700
We'll remove the clock,
raise the ceilings,

15:10.200 --> 15:13.871
and display the bags in showcases
so they can't be touched by just anyone.

15:15.998 --> 15:18.834
I need someone who knows
the workings of this industry well

15:18.918 --> 15:21.170
and will treat clients by their status.

15:23.005 --> 15:25.716
When clients leave here after shopping,

15:26.884 --> 15:30.220
I want them to feel an unparalleled sense
of immense satisfaction.

15:31.931 --> 15:35.476
And I'm certain the person
who best understands that is you.

15:37.144 --> 15:38.437
I do?

15:40.230 --> 15:44.151
I think you have an eye for beauty
others can't see.

15:46.946 --> 15:47.947
How about it?

15:48.572 --> 15:50.282
Won't you come work for me?

16:41.542 --> 16:43.585
It's Choi Chae-u
of Samwol Department Store.

16:43.669 --> 16:47.631
The chairwoman has a personal shopper,
so she doesn't come to the store herself.

16:47.715 --> 16:49.383
But the fact that she's here means…

16:50.843 --> 16:51.885
Oh no!

16:52.720 --> 16:54.221
Didn't you send her an offering?

16:55.055 --> 16:56.056
Should I have?

16:56.140 --> 16:58.225
It's an unspoken industry rule.

16:58.308 --> 17:00.811
She might be here to vent, not to shop.

17:06.066 --> 17:07.609
Don't worry.

17:07.693 --> 17:09.194
I invited her.

17:10.529 --> 17:11.530
Thank God.

17:12.031 --> 17:13.907
Countless brands pulled out of Korea

17:13.991 --> 17:16.660
because they got on
Choi Chae-u's bad side.

17:19.496 --> 17:22.207
Shall I say I invited her
by not inviting her?

17:29.548 --> 17:31.925
Thank you for visiting our humble store.

17:34.303 --> 17:36.013
Allow me to show you to the lounge.

17:36.096 --> 17:37.639
Your store is by no means humble.

17:38.766 --> 17:40.976
I may be a person of high rank,

17:41.060 --> 17:44.146
but you mustn't speak so lowly
of your brand.

18:15.219 --> 18:16.595
Shall I show you other items?

18:16.678 --> 18:18.347
No, it's not that. I don't feel…

18:20.808 --> 18:22.518
- Where is the restroom?
- This way.

18:23.977 --> 18:24.937
- Oh my God!
- Oh no.

18:25.521 --> 18:26.355
Are you all right?

18:26.438 --> 18:27.940
Bring me something to clean up!

18:28.732 --> 18:30.484
Everyone out!

18:30.567 --> 18:32.111
- Now.
- Everyone leave. Now!

18:32.194 --> 18:33.112
You too.

18:39.660 --> 18:41.537
Ms. Choi should be okay, right?

18:42.121 --> 18:43.372
I don't know.

18:46.834 --> 18:48.377
Hey, what's this?

18:48.460 --> 18:49.878
What is this?

18:50.379 --> 18:51.797
That's Ms. Kim's.

18:51.880 --> 18:53.340
YOUR NON-SMOKING CHOICE

18:53.423 --> 18:54.633
Was she a smoker?

18:54.716 --> 18:56.176
Yes, ma'am. Have you arrived?

18:56.760 --> 18:58.762
SIDE EFFECTS: NAUSEA (GAGGING)

19:01.598 --> 19:03.100
That must be so filthy.

19:03.183 --> 19:04.643
It's my job.

19:06.103 --> 19:07.271
I'm so sorry.

19:07.354 --> 19:09.273
I should've been more attentive.

19:10.065 --> 19:12.401
Having my lunch too quickly
must've been the issue.

19:13.986 --> 19:15.529
I'll pay for that bag.

19:19.741 --> 19:22.953
Don't tell me you shoved it in my face
just to sell me one?

19:24.121 --> 19:26.206
If you did, you're a master salesperson.

19:26.290 --> 19:27.666
Of course not.

19:28.375 --> 19:31.628
It's on me
for not handling things properly.

19:31.712 --> 19:33.213
There's no need for compensation.

19:35.382 --> 19:36.758
What is your name, dear?

19:37.259 --> 19:38.844
I'll tell them to promote you.

19:39.344 --> 19:40.345
Or

19:41.096 --> 19:42.639
would you like to work for me?

19:44.600 --> 19:46.560
Your kind sentiments are enough.
Thank you.

19:47.060 --> 19:50.230
It's just that I don't have a superior
who can promote me.

19:51.315 --> 19:52.149
What?

19:54.151 --> 19:55.903
I'm the regional head of this brand.

19:56.403 --> 19:59.072
You're Sarah Kim?

19:59.907 --> 20:01.992
Even the final details were perfect.

20:02.784 --> 20:05.662
We used the same courier
as the one for national exam papers.

20:07.164 --> 20:11.376
That's what we call quality
in our world. Quality.

20:14.463 --> 20:18.091
Sarah Kim was a person
of exceptional quality.

20:19.509 --> 20:22.930
Yes, ma'am. Have you been well?

20:23.013 --> 20:25.641
Sarah Kim's acknowledgement
inspired and motivated me.

20:25.724 --> 20:26.642
I'm calling because…

20:26.725 --> 20:30.062
It felt just like
when I bought my first luxury item.

20:30.687 --> 20:33.273
That's the point
where our honeymoon ended.

20:35.192 --> 20:36.526
It was far too short.

20:37.861 --> 20:41.406
So the person who brought
all those VIPs to Boudoir was…

20:42.157 --> 20:44.201
You must've earned quite a bit
in commission.

20:44.284 --> 20:45.494
As if.

20:45.577 --> 20:47.996
Do you think I'd be here
doing this if I had?

20:48.080 --> 20:50.165
I hardly had a chance to sell the bags.

20:53.126 --> 20:55.295
"Treat clients by their status"?

20:55.379 --> 20:57.506
It meant cutting out
anyone below standard.

20:58.006 --> 21:00.926
I mean, most of my job
was kicking clients out.

21:01.009 --> 21:03.303
I honestly thought,
"At this rate, we'll go bust."

21:05.472 --> 21:08.475
But I had been shortsighted.

21:09.184 --> 21:12.437
It's the nature of the rich
to chase things money can't buy.

21:13.105 --> 21:17.109
The more exclusive it became,
the more people insanely sought it out.

21:17.192 --> 21:18.026
There's a line.

21:18.110 --> 21:22.823
And as if it were all part of a plan,
Boudoir drastically raised its prices.

21:25.367 --> 21:28.704
The proprietor was king, not the customer.

21:29.621 --> 21:32.541
It was as though
it were the kingdom of Sarah Kim.

21:38.005 --> 21:39.506
Here, try it on.

21:40.007 --> 21:41.300
- Oh my.
- How much is this?

21:41.383 --> 21:42.509
That one?

21:42.592 --> 21:44.678
The Tton will be 145,000 won.

21:44.761 --> 21:46.847
My, isn't that perfect for you?

21:47.347 --> 21:48.932
You have a good eye.

21:50.267 --> 21:52.686
Just bring me a neat one
and keep the change.

21:52.769 --> 21:55.439
It seems you know
what you're talking about, pretty lady.

21:55.522 --> 21:56.606
Give me a second.

22:11.663 --> 22:13.040
What are those doing here?

22:13.123 --> 22:17.210
Unreleased bags from the new collection
were already circulating in Dongdaemun.

22:17.294 --> 22:18.837
How could this happen?

22:19.546 --> 22:21.965
Shouldn't we report this to headquarters?

22:23.258 --> 22:26.053
As long as luxury goods exist,
there will be counterfeits.

22:26.136 --> 22:29.389
There's no explanation for this
unless it was an internal leak--

22:29.473 --> 22:31.892
By the way, how did you come across this?

22:35.270 --> 22:37.606
I think that needs more explanation.

22:47.491 --> 22:51.703
Hyo-eun, take the food home in a vinyl bag
if you don't want to throw it away.

22:52.329 --> 22:53.747
You might choke on that.

22:54.790 --> 22:56.541
See? What did I tell you?

22:56.625 --> 23:00.128
Once I began to get suspicious,
I started to see all the signs.

23:00.212 --> 23:02.214
What's so weird about that?

23:02.297 --> 23:04.966
Sarah Kim used Konglish!

23:05.050 --> 23:07.844
A vinyl bag? That's called a plastic bag.

23:07.928 --> 23:10.013
No one uses such language in this world.

23:10.097 --> 23:14.393
A Korean American regional head
of a high-end brand who uses Konglish?

23:14.476 --> 23:17.979
Sarah Kim and Boudoir are all fake
from top to bottom!

23:18.063 --> 23:19.064
I'm sure of it.

23:19.147 --> 23:21.108
Just for calling it a vinyl bag?

23:21.191 --> 23:23.026
All you're giving me are your opinions.

23:23.110 --> 23:25.362
Give me some concrete proof,
Ms. Woo Hyo-eun.

23:25.445 --> 23:26.446
Seriously?

23:27.155 --> 23:30.492
God, what's with all the noise?

23:31.660 --> 23:33.870
This is my friend.

23:33.954 --> 23:35.122
Go back to sleep.

23:35.205 --> 23:36.540
- Go on.
- Who is this?

23:36.623 --> 23:37.833
Sorry.

23:37.916 --> 23:39.376
By the way, Mr. Doggo,

23:39.876 --> 23:41.837
how did you know my name?

23:43.255 --> 23:44.756
I never told you my name.

23:52.222 --> 23:53.390
Why, you…

23:58.687 --> 23:59.813
Over here!

23:59.896 --> 24:01.731
- So-ui!
- Please look over here!

24:01.815 --> 24:03.525
- So-ui!
- You're so pretty!

24:03.608 --> 24:10.615
JULIET WITH A GUN

24:11.283 --> 24:12.284
Wow! So-ui!

24:19.249 --> 24:21.251
SARAH KIM HAS BEEN MURDERED

24:34.097 --> 24:34.973
Yes, hello?

24:35.515 --> 24:36.808
Yes, sir.

24:37.851 --> 24:41.021
I think we're leaving in about 30 minutes.

24:42.939 --> 24:44.316
Yes, I understand.

24:45.192 --> 24:47.110
I think I may know who killed her.

24:48.653 --> 24:51.990
There was an uninvited guest
at the Boudoir party.

24:53.116 --> 24:55.327
God, I'm getting the chills.

24:56.161 --> 24:56.995
Who was it?

25:00.165 --> 25:03.418
It was Woo Hyo-eun,
that Boudoir salesperson.

25:04.002 --> 25:06.630
Ugly rumors were going around about her.

25:06.713 --> 25:11.009
You know, about how she's selling
clients' personal information for money.

25:11.551 --> 25:15.138
They say celebrities' phone numbers
go for a few million won.

25:16.139 --> 25:18.767
Where did you hear that?

25:19.893 --> 25:24.189
If I knew the source of the rumor,
it wouldn't be a rumor, would it?

25:26.024 --> 25:28.276
But I do know one thing for sure.

25:28.777 --> 25:32.489
Sarah Kim and Woo Hyo-eun
had a major falling out.

25:33.281 --> 25:34.908
Sarah Kim made a clean break

25:34.991 --> 25:37.160
and blacklisted her from the industry.

25:38.870 --> 25:39.704
Oh, right!

25:40.205 --> 25:42.999
I should have a video I took that day.

25:45.126 --> 25:45.961
Here.

25:53.552 --> 25:55.720
Screw you!

25:56.221 --> 25:58.848
I hope you crash and burn!

25:58.932 --> 26:01.268
- Crash and burn!
- Go fuck yourself, moron!

26:01.351 --> 26:03.019
- Fuck you! Whoa!
- What are you doing?

26:03.645 --> 26:04.771
What are you doing?

26:05.814 --> 26:08.817
Yes, video analysis confirms
that the person with Woo in the footage

26:08.900 --> 26:12.153
is Yang Da-hye,
who discovered Sarah Kim's body.

26:12.654 --> 26:15.740
They worked at the same store
a few years back,

26:16.241 --> 26:19.995
and now they run a reselling business
through unofficial channels.

26:20.078 --> 26:22.664
Find and send me
the most recent signal for Woo's phone.

26:22.747 --> 26:23.582
Yes, sir.

26:30.630 --> 26:31.631
What the…

26:32.757 --> 26:33.925
Sir?

26:34.009 --> 26:35.176
What are you doing?

26:37.887 --> 26:39.097
You're here already?

26:43.685 --> 26:44.519
Ms. Yang Da-hye?

26:45.979 --> 26:47.022
Hello.

26:51.693 --> 26:52.694
What are you doing?

26:53.194 --> 26:54.946
Here, have a hand warmer.

26:58.617 --> 27:01.453
They say they have proof
that Boudoir is a fake.

27:03.788 --> 27:05.832
Wait, that woman is dead?

27:08.001 --> 27:11.630
Ms. Yang, you were the one
who discovered Sarah Kim's body.

27:12.380 --> 27:14.299
What? You were?

27:15.300 --> 27:17.177
So are you telling me

27:17.260 --> 27:20.597
that the body with the smashed up face
was Sarah Kim?

27:24.267 --> 27:25.435
Damn.

27:26.478 --> 27:28.772
She really crashed and burned, didn't she?

27:30.649 --> 27:32.025
Did you really not know?

27:33.193 --> 27:35.737
No, I didn't. I was so overwhelmed.

27:39.032 --> 27:42.327
Wait, are you suspecting us right now?

27:43.828 --> 27:44.663
Look.

27:45.705 --> 27:49.250
Da-hye proved she'd been camping
outside the store for the opening rush.

27:49.334 --> 27:52.379
I was there with her,
so I've got an alibi too, right?

27:52.462 --> 27:54.631
Tell them, Yang-da.

27:54.714 --> 27:57.592
I already told them dozens of times
during the interview.

27:58.093 --> 28:02.013
Maybe you held a grudge
over being unfairly fired from Boudoir?

28:02.097 --> 28:03.890
Wait, you were fired?

28:05.767 --> 28:09.312
The two of you gatecrashed and terrorized
the party on the day of the murder.

28:09.396 --> 28:10.897
Hey, that's a bit harsh.

28:10.980 --> 28:12.607
- "Terrorized"?
- That's a bit much.

28:12.691 --> 28:14.359
That's a gross exaggeration.

28:14.442 --> 28:16.611
I'd call it a curse.

28:17.445 --> 28:19.364
Just so you know,

28:20.156 --> 28:23.702
I had a smoking gun
that would have ruined Sarah Kim.

28:23.785 --> 28:26.121
What exactly was this smoking gun?

28:31.543 --> 28:32.377
Her.

28:33.795 --> 28:34.629
Oh.

28:35.422 --> 28:38.383
Well, about a month ago,

28:39.342 --> 28:41.469
I visited the Boudoir store.

28:41.553 --> 28:45.223
Ma'am, would you like to try this on?
It's part of our newest collection.

28:45.306 --> 28:46.975
It's totally my style.

28:47.058 --> 28:48.184
Allow me, ma'am.

28:48.268 --> 28:49.394
Yes, thank…

28:51.146 --> 28:51.980
Photo, please.

28:52.063 --> 28:54.482
- Please handle with care.
- Of course.

28:56.151 --> 28:57.068
- Looks good.
- Pretty!

28:57.152 --> 28:58.069
It's gorgeous.

28:58.570 --> 29:00.447
That totally goes with your outfit today!

29:00.947 --> 29:04.993
Are you sure it's okay for us to do this?
Didn't you say your boss was super strict?

29:05.076 --> 29:07.954
It's fine. She doesn't come to work
at this hour.

29:08.037 --> 29:09.914
Really? That's a relief.

29:10.415 --> 29:12.417
Ma'am, would you like to try on
another bag?

29:13.251 --> 29:16.463
I almost died
trying to get that money together.

29:16.546 --> 29:18.715
This is pretty much my life savings.

29:18.798 --> 29:21.509
I'd say splurge even more,
even if you have to borrow money.

29:21.593 --> 29:24.179
These are not bags. They're jewels.

29:24.804 --> 29:25.805
Really?

29:25.889 --> 29:27.015
Let's try this one.

29:27.098 --> 29:27.932
Try it on.

29:30.643 --> 29:32.562
Is there anything else you need?

29:33.646 --> 29:34.481
Sorry?

29:35.774 --> 29:36.775
No, I'm fine.

29:41.196 --> 29:44.783
The client requested
a private appointment,

29:44.866 --> 29:47.160
as she is anxiously social.

29:48.620 --> 29:49.996
I see.

29:51.498 --> 29:52.582
Please excuse me.

29:53.082 --> 29:54.584
Hope you have a pleasant time.

29:55.418 --> 29:56.252
Thank you.

30:08.014 --> 30:10.016
You said she wouldn't be here, damn it!

30:10.099 --> 30:10.934
Did we fool her?

30:13.394 --> 30:14.312
- Hey!
- What?

30:14.395 --> 30:16.189
What was that? Don't you have a brain?

30:16.272 --> 30:19.484
You're one to talk. "Anxiously social"?
It's social anxiety, fool!

30:19.567 --> 30:22.362
- Anxiously social?
- Anxiously social, my ass.

30:22.987 --> 30:24.405
What the hell did I say? Oh no.

30:24.489 --> 30:27.992
Good thing I came wearing
all these fakes, at least.

30:28.618 --> 30:29.911
She totally fell for it.

30:31.788 --> 30:33.289
Are you an African tribal chief?

30:33.790 --> 30:35.583
At least stick to one jewelry brand.

30:35.667 --> 30:38.545
And take that necklace off.
It doesn't suit you.

30:38.628 --> 30:40.964
Hey, this is the only piece that's real!

30:41.047 --> 30:42.340
It doesn't look real on you!

30:42.423 --> 30:43.716
Bite me!

30:43.800 --> 30:44.759
Wait, that's real?

30:44.843 --> 30:45.969
It's totally real.

30:46.678 --> 30:49.556
I almost got humiliated
for being caught wearing a fake,

30:49.639 --> 30:51.099
so I bought this right away.

30:58.940 --> 31:00.108
No, wait.

31:00.191 --> 31:02.193
Look, that camel one is gorgeous!

31:02.694 --> 31:04.612
- Leave!
- Just three minutes. Okay, one.

31:04.696 --> 31:06.573
Just one second, then. Come on!

31:06.656 --> 31:09.450
I'm going to die of a heart attack,
you crazy girl!

31:09.534 --> 31:10.743
Okay.

31:11.744 --> 31:14.414
Calm down and chant the power word.

31:16.207 --> 31:17.876
The Big Three!

31:18.918 --> 31:20.003
It'll be all right.

31:20.086 --> 31:21.629
Damn.

31:22.422 --> 31:23.590
So, you're saying

31:24.090 --> 31:26.009
that person is Sarah Kim, right?

31:26.926 --> 31:29.637
I swear I've seen her somewhere.
Where did I see her?

31:29.721 --> 31:31.723
You probably saw her at the store.

31:31.806 --> 31:33.099
She's a shopaholic.

31:33.600 --> 31:35.727
You want to fire me?

31:36.811 --> 31:39.480
I expected only one thing
from you, Hyo-eun.

31:39.981 --> 31:41.941
That you act according to status.

31:42.942 --> 31:45.820
What you did was like
wearing open-toed shoes with pantyhose.

31:47.322 --> 31:48.781
Can you sign and leave now?

31:49.282 --> 31:52.911
"Wearing open-toed shoes with pantyhose"
means you've broken etiquette.

31:52.994 --> 31:55.038
Yes, I'll send over the revised policy.

31:55.121 --> 31:57.081
This is Kim Yu-jin
of Korea Life Insurance.

31:57.624 --> 31:59.292
Sure. I'll be in touch.

32:14.349 --> 32:16.768
But our store doesn't have
any openings right now.

32:17.810 --> 32:22.315
Maybe this is a good chance for you
to pivot and try beauty or SPA brands?

32:23.232 --> 32:26.194
I've been in this field for a while.
I can't just start over.

32:26.694 --> 32:30.073
Are you feigning ignorance,
or do you really not know?

32:31.240 --> 32:32.075
Sorry?

32:32.158 --> 32:35.495
This industry has ears everywhere.
Did you think word wouldn't get around?

32:38.081 --> 32:42.085
I heard you sold personal info of clients
to an insurance company.

32:42.168 --> 32:43.336
What?

32:43.419 --> 32:44.462
I did what?

32:45.004 --> 32:46.923
Wait, what are you…

32:51.427 --> 32:53.429
This is Kim Yu-jin
of Korea Life Insurance.

32:58.226 --> 32:59.686
Why, that fucking…

33:00.520 --> 33:02.563
She's a total crazy bitch.

33:06.359 --> 33:08.945
She's behind this whole thing. Sarah Kim…

33:10.697 --> 33:12.240
Sarah Kim set the whole thing up.

33:12.323 --> 33:14.033
Sarah Kim did?

33:14.826 --> 33:15.827
Why would she?

33:15.910 --> 33:17.286
My point exactly! Why?

33:17.870 --> 33:19.831
Why the hell is she doing this to me?

33:20.331 --> 33:21.708
Damn it. Seriously.

33:23.418 --> 33:25.378
What in the world happened to you?

33:26.671 --> 33:30.258
Look, if your boss hadn't stepped in,

33:30.341 --> 33:31.884
you'd be in jail already.

33:31.968 --> 33:33.011
Get it?

33:33.094 --> 33:36.264
It was only when I began
to look for a job again

33:36.347 --> 33:41.019
that I realized Sarah Kim had kicked me
out of the industry, not Boudoir.

33:41.102 --> 33:43.021
TIP WITH SCREENSHOTS
NOTE IF ANONYMOUS

33:43.104 --> 33:46.315
EXPOSING SARAH KIM, THE CON ARTIST

33:53.573 --> 33:54.949
Did you get off work already?

33:55.908 --> 33:56.743
Hey!

33:58.327 --> 34:00.288
I got fired!

34:00.371 --> 34:01.456
What?

34:02.665 --> 34:06.085
Someone filed a complaint
saying I violated the grooming guidelines.

34:07.879 --> 34:10.798
Some crap about me
"wearing open-toed shoes with pantyhose."

34:11.674 --> 34:13.593
Who wears open-toed shoes in winter?

34:13.676 --> 34:15.803
My hands and feet are always cold.

34:16.554 --> 34:19.015
I get it if it's just me. But Yang-da too?

34:19.098 --> 34:20.516
This was her taking revenge.

34:20.600 --> 34:21.726
Hey, get up.

34:22.226 --> 34:25.188
You said you'd seen Sarah Kim before.
Do you recall where?

34:25.271 --> 34:29.192
And that's when we realized
that Sarah Kim was not kicking us out.

34:29.275 --> 34:30.693
She was avoiding us.

34:31.194 --> 34:33.738
I can't remember for the life of me.

34:34.572 --> 34:39.243
How about I try hypnosis?
It seems to work on Unanswered Questions.

34:40.369 --> 34:41.454
In conclusion,

34:42.413 --> 34:43.664
you don't know.

34:43.748 --> 34:46.084
- She's on the verge of finding out.
- Yeah.

34:46.167 --> 34:47.168
Let us finish.

34:47.251 --> 34:52.006
Then did you know Sarah Kim had stolen
your identity, Ms. Woo?

34:52.090 --> 34:53.007
- She what?
- What?

34:53.508 --> 34:54.342
My identity?

34:54.425 --> 34:58.137
Sarah Kim underwent a police investigation
using a copy of your ID.

35:00.765 --> 35:01.933
Damn!

35:02.016 --> 35:03.017
No way!

35:03.684 --> 35:04.936
No wonder.

35:05.019 --> 35:07.021
I kept getting weird notices from court.

35:07.105 --> 35:10.441
She must've used the copy of my ID
I submitted with the job contract.

35:11.150 --> 35:13.402
Hey, you've made it now. Congratulations.

35:14.195 --> 35:17.824
This isn't exactly a laughing matter,
don't you think?

35:17.907 --> 35:18.950
It's funny, isn't it?

35:19.033 --> 35:20.243
- Totally.
- It's brief.

35:20.326 --> 35:22.120
But she wanted to be me for that time.

35:23.287 --> 35:24.288
By the way,

35:24.372 --> 35:25.832
Mr. Doggo, this is for you.

35:26.707 --> 35:28.084
Open it.

35:30.253 --> 35:32.255
I collected bits and pieces
of what I could,

35:32.338 --> 35:33.673
but it's not much.

35:36.968 --> 35:37.969
That's not true.

35:38.052 --> 35:39.762
There is a lot of evidence in here.

35:40.429 --> 35:42.223
Why didn't you report her sooner?

35:54.235 --> 35:57.488
She burned the entire remaining stock
when the season ended.

35:58.447 --> 36:00.867
She would've preferred
to destroy the bags herself

36:00.950 --> 36:03.202
than see them be treated
as leftover stock.

36:12.044 --> 36:15.840
Sarah Kim really did love Boudoir.

36:17.091 --> 36:18.551
It may have been all fake,

36:19.093 --> 36:20.678
but it wasn't a lie.

36:22.680 --> 36:26.225
Which is why people of high rank
hung onto her every word.

36:26.309 --> 36:29.270
I heard the brand is pushing
to get into a department store.

36:30.021 --> 36:32.106
Why didn't I report her?

36:33.608 --> 36:36.903
Do you think those people would allow
their names to be tarnished?

36:39.155 --> 36:40.239
ENTERTAINMENT

36:40.323 --> 36:41.532
POLITICAL/BUSINESS CIRCLES

36:41.616 --> 36:44.368
Is it Samwol Department Store,
by any chance?

36:46.871 --> 36:50.541
Did Sarah Kim have anyone around her
who could help her?

36:50.625 --> 36:52.418
It's all there in the notebook.

36:53.377 --> 36:56.589
The secrets, tastes, and even minor habits
of the VIPs I managed.

36:56.672 --> 36:57.840
BANG EUN-SUK (COLUMNIST)

36:58.716 --> 37:01.010
KANG EUN-JEONG (ASSEMBLYMAN'S WIFE)
VVIP SOCIAL CLUB MEMBER

37:01.093 --> 37:02.386
Are these their sizes?

37:02.929 --> 37:04.263
Cell phone patterns.

37:05.264 --> 37:07.266
I tend to write it all down. Just in case.

37:08.476 --> 37:10.478
Why? Do I seem shady?

37:13.606 --> 37:14.690
What about Sarah Kim?

37:16.275 --> 37:18.569
The only thing I know about that woman

37:19.528 --> 37:21.906
is that I don't know anything about her.

37:22.907 --> 37:25.284
You can figure out the rest,
Mr. Handsome Detective.

37:36.879 --> 37:38.047
Yes, we've arrived.

37:41.384 --> 37:42.802
What do you think you're doing?

37:44.262 --> 37:45.972
This is a search and seizure warrant.

37:46.055 --> 37:47.974
Do not touch anything from now on!

37:48.057 --> 37:49.183
- Get started.
- Yes, sir.

37:51.477 --> 37:52.687
- Excuse me.
- Excuse me.

37:55.398 --> 37:56.691
I suggest you step back.

37:56.774 --> 37:59.652
That costs 100 million won.
Can you even pay if it's scratched?

38:01.404 --> 38:02.530
Gloves, please.

38:07.660 --> 38:09.662
She's already cleared out her things.

38:24.885 --> 38:26.470
Just one week…

38:27.054 --> 38:31.559
Just make it through a week.

38:35.062 --> 38:35.980
Excuse me.

38:37.565 --> 38:39.066
I don't have a handkerchief.

38:50.453 --> 38:51.620
Isn't it your day off?

38:52.121 --> 38:54.040
Something about the timeline doesn't fit.

38:54.540 --> 38:55.499
What timeline?

38:55.583 --> 38:58.002
I found the first online post
about Boudoir.

38:58.085 --> 38:59.795
It was dated five years ago.

39:00.588 --> 39:03.299
But actual sales of the brand

39:03.799 --> 39:05.009
only started last May.

39:06.010 --> 39:09.305
A bag review written five years ago
when Boudoir wasn't even in Korea.

39:09.930 --> 39:14.018
I figured we might get lucky,
so I asked the portal to verify the user.

39:15.478 --> 39:16.604
What about you, sir?

39:23.694 --> 39:25.404
I'm going to go back to square one.

39:25.905 --> 39:27.490
The scene of the crime never lies.

39:27.573 --> 39:30.951
The body was found
in the luxury street of Cheongdam-dong,

39:31.452 --> 39:34.372
an area where there are dozens
of security cameras in a block.

39:34.455 --> 39:37.917
But the suspect dumps the body
without being seen on a single camera?

39:38.000 --> 39:39.627
That's absolutely impossible.

39:39.710 --> 39:41.003
There's only one answer.

39:45.216 --> 39:46.050
The sewers!

39:46.842 --> 39:50.846
But didn't the forensic team
already comb through the area?

39:50.930 --> 39:52.223
Not all of it.

39:53.224 --> 39:56.102
If you want to know about rock bottom,
you have to become it.

39:56.602 --> 39:57.812
Come with me.

39:59.105 --> 40:00.523
Am I going with you?

40:00.606 --> 40:01.649
Don't you want to?

40:02.149 --> 40:03.275
Sir…

40:03.943 --> 40:07.238
No, I want to. I so want to.
I'd freaking love to!

40:26.215 --> 40:28.717
I thought you'd freaking love to.
You so wanted to.

40:33.347 --> 40:34.265
Damn.

40:38.561 --> 40:39.770
Oh, look!

40:39.854 --> 40:41.897
Oxygen tanks go for 200,000 won
on Coupang!

40:42.898 --> 40:43.858
See?

40:43.941 --> 40:45.776
I'll go down when they arrive tomorrow.

40:46.277 --> 40:50.281
I read an article about someone
who died from toxic fumes cleaning sewers.

40:51.240 --> 40:52.658
- Get out.
- Yes, sir.

40:56.078 --> 40:57.455
What are you doing?

40:58.664 --> 41:00.082
Oh, I'm sorry.

41:02.460 --> 41:04.420
Gas mask, walkie-talkie, flashlight.

41:20.019 --> 41:21.854
Why do I even bother?

41:50.382 --> 41:52.134
Keep going straight,

41:52.218 --> 41:54.470
then turn left once you see a passage.

42:26.877 --> 42:31.048
Gradually, you will forget
you're even breathing.

42:32.007 --> 42:35.636
I simply exist in this space.

42:36.679 --> 42:40.224
Far in the distance,
I see the door to my memories.

42:41.225 --> 42:44.645
Now, open the door with energy.

42:45.896 --> 42:47.147
One,

42:47.231 --> 42:48.232
two,

42:48.315 --> 42:49.275
three.

42:49.358 --> 42:50.192
I remember!

42:50.276 --> 42:51.986
Fucking hell! You scared me.

42:52.486 --> 42:53.612
Holy cow.

42:54.238 --> 42:55.948
I met that bitch

42:57.449 --> 42:59.201
at an employee sale.

42:59.952 --> 43:00.786
What?

43:03.247 --> 43:04.081
Her name was…

43:04.164 --> 43:05.165
Her name was?

43:05.249 --> 43:07.251
Fuck, what was it?

43:07.334 --> 43:08.168
Sir!

43:08.252 --> 43:09.211
Sir!

43:16.510 --> 43:20.014
RE: REQUEST OF USER INFO
FOR "CHEONGDAM GODDESS" OF NOBILITY

43:24.476 --> 43:27.479
USER NICKNAME: CHEONGDAM GODDESS
USER NAME: MOK GA-HUI

43:29.148 --> 43:30.149
- Mok Ga-hui?
- Mok Ga-hui.

43:45.039 --> 43:48.834
MOK GA-HUI

45:13.794 --> 45:18.799
Subtitle translation by: Yung Un Choi
